    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;RrrrrAbbits&quot; is a real-fantasy bunny action game about rebuilding the devastated Rabbit Village after a devastating attack by crows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/44b6b5c43928e15717498e2d54cbacbf.poster.avif?t=1754296892\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/44b6b5c43928e15717498e2d54cbacbf.webm?t=1754296892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/44b6b5c43928e15717498e2d54cbacbf.mp4?t=1754296892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the charismatic leader bunny, you\u2019ll explore the city, gather materials, battle crow invaders, and guide your fluffy companions to restore your beloved home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Leader Bunny is No Ordinary Bunny</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/00cb0509e39418cc8140480a73914cc5.poster.avif?t=1754296892\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/00cb0509e39418cc8140480a73914cc5.webm?t=1754296892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/00cb0509e39418cc8140480a73914cc5.mp4?t=1754296892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/cf1eb99c66645ab935ec75b0ee5924df.poster.avif?t=1754296892\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/cf1eb99c66645ab935ec75b0ee5924df.webm?t=1754296892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/cf1eb99c66645ab935ec75b0ee5924df.mp4?t=1754296892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just any rabbit\u2014you\u2019re the chosen one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special \u201cBunny Power\u201d to double-jump, attack mid-air, or float with a balloon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash, search, and uncover useful items hidden in the city ruins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, Trusty Bunny Allies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and rescue rare bunnies with powerful abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From treasure-hunters to battle experts and builders, your squad will grow stronger with every new friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your fluff-filled team to survival and victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;RrrrrAbbits&quot; is a real-fantasy bunny action game about rebuilding the devastated Rabbit Village after a devastating attack by crows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/44b6b5c43928e15717498e2d54cbacbf.poster.avif?t=1754296892\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/44b6b5c43928e15717498e2d54cbacbf.webm?t=1754296892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/44b6b5c43928e15717498e2d54cbacbf.mp4?t=1754296892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the charismatic leader bunny, you\u2019ll explore the city, gather materials, battle crow invaders, and guide your fluffy companions to restore your beloved home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Leader Bunny is No Ordinary Bunny</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/00cb0509e39418cc8140480a73914cc5.poster.avif?t=1754296892\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/00cb0509e39418cc8140480a73914cc5.webm?t=1754296892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/00cb0509e39418cc8140480a73914cc5.mp4?t=1754296892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/cf1eb99c66645ab935ec75b0ee5924df.poster.avif?t=1754296892\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/cf1eb99c66645ab935ec75b0ee5924df.webm?t=1754296892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421220/extras/cf1eb99c66645ab935ec75b0ee5924df.mp4?t=1754296892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just any rabbit\u2014you\u2019re the chosen one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special \u201cBunny Power\u201d to double-jump, attack mid-air, or float with a balloon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash, search, and uncover useful items hidden in the city ruins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, Trusty Bunny Allies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and rescue rare bunnies with powerful abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From treasure-hunters to battle experts and builders, your squad will grow stronger with every new friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your fluff-filled team to survival and victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
